# Halt on a locked signature

`.cursor/hooks/locked-classes.txt` freezes public, internal, and protected signatures (Rust `pub` / `pub(crate)` / `pub(super)`). Method bodies and private members on those types can change.

When the change needs a locked signature, stop and name that member. A wrapper, second field, or extra path that carries the same data through an existing signature is not a substitute.

Say "locked" only for a signature on that list. Tests, files, and generate output are pinned or asserted, not locked.
